cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the FOI-O NZ semantic core, cite this release and preserve its
  per-file licence manifest.
title: "FOI-O NZ semantic core"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mordaunt
    given-names: Dylan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-1152-7383"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/edithatogo/foi-o"
abstract: >-
  A bounded semantic artifact containing the FOI-O NZ JSON-LD context,
  ontology, SHACL shapes, and controlled vocabularies. It excludes source
  content, empirical evidence, extraction contracts, and analytics.
